Text:
fearlessManager is a program.
The 'single' manager is the fearlessManager that holds the lock of the LockFile "single_manager_at_" Port ".lock" of the ManagerFolder, and listens on Port.
The 'single' manager receives the messages that fearlessMessage sends, one at a time.
A 'ManagerFolder' is a folder holding one file with a name of form LockFile, the file projects.info, and the folders icons and locks.
The 'manager path' is the path of the ManagerFolder.
The 'refused paths' are DeskPaths that the implementation chooses for each operating system; os$currentDesk().deskPath of the 'manager path' is one of the 'refused paths'.
fearlessManager, run with no parameters, and fearlessMessage, run with one Message, deduce the same 'manager path'.
The folder locks holds the files that show which mounted data a running project uses.
projects.info is a file containing an Info serialized as defined in the fearless standard library; only fearlessManager writes projects.info.
TaggedText.str and Str.taggedText have no Notation: TaggedText.str is a bijection from the values of TaggedText to some values of Str, and Str.taggedText is the inverse of TaggedText.str.
TypeName.str and Str.typeName have no Notation: TypeName.str is a bijection from the values of TypeName to some values of Str, and Str.typeName is the inverse of TypeName.str.
ProjectName.str and Str.projectName have no Notation: ProjectName.str is a bijection from the values of ProjectName to some values of Str, and Str.projectName is the inverse of ProjectName.str.
Kind.str and Str.kind have no Notation: Kind.str is a bijection from the values of Kind to some values of Str, and Str.kind is the inverse of Kind.str.
A TaggedText, a TypeName, a ProjectName or a Kind that is the argument of Infos.msg(..), or a key of an Infos.map, stands for its .str: Infos.msg(TaggedText) is Infos.msg(TaggedText.str).
Infos.msg(#empty), Infos.list() and Infos.map() are one Info, the empty Info.
Info[..] makes a new Info with a little difference; for example ProjectsInfo[+=Project] makes a new Info where the list contains also that Project.
Info.Str is the Info that the key Str maps to in the Infos.map Info; for example Project.#path is Infos.msg(TaggedText), where TaggedText is the path of Project.
Message[Target=Target'] makes a new Message where Target is replaced by Target'.
fearlessManager.projectsInfo is a ProjectsInfo held in memory; fearlessManager.projectsInfo starts as Infos.list().
dom(Names) is the set of the keys of Names.
fearlessManager.names is a Names held in memory; fearlessManager.names starts as {}.
dom(fearlessManager.names) holds only the paths of fearlessManager.projectsInfo whose Fearless project had a name that no other of those Fearless projects had, when fearlessManager last read those Fearless projects.
fearlessManager.queue is a Queue held in memory; fearlessManager.queue starts empty.
dom(LongLivedMap) is the set of the keys of LongLivedMap.
fearlessManager.longLivedMessages is a LongLivedMap held in memory; fearlessManager.longLivedMessages starts as {}.
(Base16->LongLivedMessage) is in fearlessManager.longLivedMessages exactly while the 'child process' of LongLivedMessage runs.
At the end of each Story, fearlessManager closes each connection that no Message of fearlessManager.queue, no Message of fearlessManager.longLivedMessages and no Story that has not ended keeps.

Text:
Design principles:
- We only re read the names of the Fearless projects directly involved in the operations we perform.
- We keep both the Base16 and the user friendly names, since we are the only piece of software that is in the right position to do it right.

Grammar:
ProjectsInfo ::= Infos.list(Project1 .. Projectn)
TypeNames ::= Infos.list(Infos.msg(TypeName1) .. Infos.msg(TypeNamen))
Project ::= Infos.map(#path, Infos.msg(TaggedText), #kind, Infos.msg(Kind), #mains, TypeNames, #mounts, Mount, #attenuators, Attenuator)
Mount ::= Infos.map(TypeName1, Infos.msg(ProjectName1) .. TypeNamen, Infos.msg(ProjectNamen))
Attenuator ::= Infos.map(TypeName1, TypeNames1 .. TypeNamen, TypeNamesn)
Kind ::= "idle" | "code" | "data"
ProjectName ::= [a-z_][a-z0-9_]*
TaggedText ::= \
  Base16                                 \
  | "Str:" EscapedChar1 .. EscapedCharn \
  | "UStr:" EscapedChar1 .. EscapedCharn
EscapedChar ::= [0-9A-Za-z+\-*/=<>,.;:()\[\]{}`'!?@#$%^&_|~\\] | "\"" | " "
Names ::= Name1 .. Namen
Name ::= (TaggedText->ProjectName)
TypeName ::= PackageName "." TypeBaseName
PackageName ::= [a-z][a-z0-9_]*
TypeBaseName ::= [_]*[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*[']*
ValidSegment ::= SegmentBase | SegmentBase "." OSExtension | SegmentBase "." MultiExtension
SegmentBase ::= [a-z_][a-z0-9_]{0,190}
OSExtension ::= [a-z0-9]{1,16}
MultiExtension ::= "css.map" | "d.ts" | "d.ts.map" | "js.map" | "min.css" | "min.js" | "tar.bz2" | "tar.gz" | "tar.lz" | "tar.lz4" | "tar.xz" | "tar.zst"
ReservedName ::= "con" | "prn" | "aux" | "nul" | "com" [1-9] | "lpt" [1-9]
Info ::= Infos.msg(Str) | Infos.list(Info1 .. Infon) | Infos.map(Str1, Info1 .. Strn, Infon)
#empty, #path, #kind, #mains, #mounts, #attenuators in Str
LockFile ::= "no_manager.lock" | "candidate_manager.lock" | "single_manager_at_" Port ".lock"
Port ::= [1-9][0-9]*
Queue ::= "\t" Message1 "\n" .. "\t" Messagen "\n"
LongLivedMessage ::= "Run Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")" | "Compile Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")"//Some Messages are also LongLivedMessage
LongLivedMap ::= (Base161->LongLivedMessage1) .. (Base16n->LongLivedMessagen)
DirectMessage ::= "EditMetadata " Info | "Terminate " Base16 | "Check Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")" | "RefreshCache"

Well formedness:
in LongLivedMap: Base161 .. Base16n are disjoint
in Names: Name1.TaggedText .. Namen.TaggedText are disjoint, and Name1.ProjectName .. Namen.ProjectName are disjoint
in ProjectsInfo: Project1.#path .. Projectn.#path are disjoint
in Project: Project.#mains is Infos.list(Infos.msg(TypeName1) .. Infos.msg(TypeNamen)) with TypeName1 .. TypeNamen disjoint
in ProjectName: ProjectName ".fearless" is of form ValidSegment
in TaggedText: if TaggedText is "Str:" EscapedChar1 .. EscapedCharn, then EscapedChar1 .. EscapedCharn is the result of\
  p.escape where p is a Fearless Str encoding a valid OS FS path
in TaggedText: if TaggedText is "UStr:" EscapedChar1 .. EscapedCharn, then EscapedChar1 .. EscapedCharn is the result of\
  p.escape where p is a Fearless UStr encoding a valid OS FS path, and p.isStr is False
in TaggedText: TaggedText is of form Base16 only if no Fearless UStr encodes the path that TaggedText decodes to
in TaggedText: os$currentDesk().deskPath(TaggedText) is defined
in TaggedText: os$currentDesk().deskPath(TaggedText) does not start with one of the 'refused paths'
in SegmentBase: SegmentBase is not of form ReservedName
in Info: if Info is Infos.map(Str1, Info1 .. Strn, Infon), then Str1 .. Strn are disjoint
in Port: Port is a number smaller than 65536

Notation: Base16.taggedText = TaggedText where:
- Base16 and TaggedText encode the same path

Notation: Names.projectNameToBase16(ProjectName) = Base16 where:
- Names = Names1 (Base16.taggedText->ProjectName) Names2
- (_->ProjectName) not in Names1 Names2

Notation: Names.projectNameToProject(ProjectsInfo,ProjectName) = Project where:
- ProjectsInfo.get(Names.projectNameToBase16(ProjectName)) = Project

Notation: Message.needsDelegation where:
- Message is not "Quit"
- Message is not of form DirectMessage
- Message is not of form LongLivedMessage

Notation: ProjectsInfo.get(Base16) = Project where:
- Project in ProjectsInfo
- Project.#path = Infos.msg(Base16.taggedText)

Notation: TaggedText in ProjectsInfo.paths where:
- _Project[#path=Infos.msg(TaggedText)] in ProjectsInfo

Define fearlessManager$readFSOptTaggedTextInProjectName(Infos.msg(TaggedText)):
A if the Fearless project at TaggedText has the name ProjectName, return (TaggedText->ProjectName)
B action return {}

Define fearlessManager$rereadCachedNames(Infos.list(Project1 .. Projectn)):
A action fearlessManager$readFSOptTaggedTextInProjectName(Project1.#path) .. fearlessManager$readFSOptTaggedTextInProjectName(Projectn.#path) = Name1 .. Namem
B action return (Name1 .. Namem).filter((_->ProjectName)->exactly one of Name1 .. Namem is of form (_->ProjectName))

Define fearlessManager$consistent(TaggedText,Names,ProjectsInfo):
A if TaggedText not in dom(Names), error messageErrorNoFearlessProjectAtPath(TaggedText)
B action os$currentDesk() = Desk
C if Desk.at(TaggedText) is undefined, error messageErrorNoFearlessProjectAtPath(TaggedText)
D if Desk.anyIsSameOrInside(TaggedText, ProjectsInfo.paths - {TaggedText}), error messageErrorProjectSameOrInsideOtherProject(TaggedText)

Define fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage("EditMetadata " Info):
A fact Info is not of form ProjectsInfo.
B action error messageErrorNewMetadataIsNotValid(Info)

Define fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage("EditMetadata " ProjectsInfo):
A fact ProjectsInfo.paths = fearlessManager.projectsInfo.paths
B action return fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage("EditMetadata " ProjectsInfo,fearlessManager.names)

Define fearlessManager$namesAfterEdit(ProjectsInfo):
A action return fearlessManager.names.filter((TaggedText->_)->TaggedText in ProjectsInfo.paths) (ProjectsInfo.paths - fearlessManager.projectsInfo.paths).map(TaggedText->fearlessManager$readFSOptTaggedTextInProjectName(Infos.msg(TaggedText)))

Define fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage("EditMetadata " ProjectsInfo):
A fact ProjectsInfo.paths != fearlessManager.projectsInfo.paths
B action fearlessManager$namesAfterEdit(ProjectsInfo) = Names
C action return fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage("EditMetadata " ProjectsInfo,Names)

Define fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage("EditMetadata " ProjectsInfo):
A fact ProjectsInfo.paths != fearlessManager.projectsInfo.paths
B fact fearlessManager$namesAfterEdit(ProjectsInfo) is undefined.
C action fearlessManager.queue= "\tRefreshCache\n" fearlessManager.queue
D action error messageErrorNewMetadataIsNotValid(ProjectsInfo)

Define fearlessManager$checkBusyProjectNotChanged(ProjectName,Base16,ProjectsInfo):
A if fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16) not in ProjectsInfo, error messageErrorProjectIsBusy(ProjectName,Base16)

Define fearlessManager$checkProjectsOfLongLivedMessageNotChanged("Compile Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")",ProjectsInfo):
A action fearlessManager$checkBusyProjectNotChanged(ProjectName,Base16,ProjectsInfo)

Define fearlessManager$checkProjectsOfLongLivedMessageNotChanged("Run Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")",ProjectsInfo):
A action fearlessManager$checkBusyProjectNotChanged(ProjectName,Base16,ProjectsInfo)
B fact fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16).#mounts = Infos.map(TypeName1, Infos.msg(ProjectName1) .. TypeNamen, Infos.msg(ProjectNamen))
C action fearlessManager$checkBusyProjectNotChanged(ProjectName1,fearlessManager.names.projectNameToBase16(ProjectName1),ProjectsInfo) .. fearlessManager$checkBusyProjectNotChanged(ProjectNamen,fearlessManager.names.projectNameToBase16(ProjectNamen),ProjectsInfo)

Define fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage("EditMetadata " ProjectsInfo,Names):
A fact fearlessManager.longLivedMessages = (_->LongLivedMessage1) .. (_->LongLivedMessagem)
B action fearlessManager$checkProjectsOfLongLivedMessageNotChanged(LongLivedMessage1,ProjectsInfo) .. fearlessManager$checkProjectsOfLongLivedMessageNotChanged(LongLivedMessagem,ProjectsInfo)
C fact {TaggedText1 .. TaggedTextn} = ProjectsInfo.paths - fearlessManager.projectsInfo.paths
D action fearlessManager$consistent(TaggedText1,Names,ProjectsInfo) .. fearlessManager$consistent(TaggedTextn,Names,ProjectsInfo)
E action fearlessManager removes the folder .fearless_out of the Fearless project at TaggedText1 .. the folder .fearless_out of the Fearless project at TaggedTextn
//later: at the start of fearlessManager, fearlessManager$loadProjectsInfo() reaches line E with every registered project, so each start of fearlessManager removes every folder .fearless_out. This is intended for now; a later version removes fewer folders.
F action fearlessManager.names= Names
G action fearlessManager.projectsInfo= ProjectsInfo
H action fearlessManager replaces projects.info with ProjectsInfo serialized
I action fearlessManager tells the manager GUI, if the manager GUI runs, to read projects.info again

Define fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage("RefreshCache"):
A fact fearlessManager.longLivedMessages = {}
B action fearlessManager.names= fearlessManager$rereadCachedNames(fearlessManager.projectsInfo)

Define fearlessManager$checkFullTargetIsCorrect("Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")"):
A if fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16) is undefined, error messageErrorBase16NotAssociatedWithAnyRegisteredProject(Base16)
B fact The Fearless project at Base16 has the name ProjectName.

Define fearlessManager$checkFullTargetIsCorrect("Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")"):
A fact fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16) is defined, and the Fearless project at Base16 does not have the name ProjectName.
B action fearlessManager.queue= "\tRefreshCache\n" fearlessManager.queue
C action error messageErrorNameNotAssociatedWithBase16(ProjectName,Base16)

Define fearlessManager$delegate("EditMetadata " Base16):
A if the file at Base16 holds Info serialized, return "EditMetadata " Info
B action error messageErrorNoInfoInFileAtBase16(Base16)

Define fearlessManager$delegate(Message):
A fact Message.Targets contains "Name(" ProjectName ")".
B try return Message["Name(" ProjectName ")"="Full(" ProjectName " " fearlessManager.names.projectNameToBase16(ProjectName) ")"]
C action fearlessManager.queue= "\tRefreshCache\n" fearlessManager.queue
D action error messageErrorNameNotAssociatedWithAnyRegisteredProject(ProjectName)

Define fearlessManager$delegate("Register " Base16):
A if Base16.taggedText is undefined, error messageErrorPathOfBase16CanNotBeRegistered(Base16)
B if fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16) is defined, return "EditMetadata " fearlessManager.projectsInfo
C action return "EditMetadata " fearlessManager.projectsInfo[+=Infos.map(#path, Infos.msg(Base16.taggedText), #kind, Infos.msg("idle"), #mains, Infos.list(), #mounts, Infos.map(), #attenuators, Infos.map())]//"idle" is a Kind, so Infos.msg("idle") is Infos.msg("idle".str)

Define fearlessManager$delegate("Forget " Base16):
A if fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16) = Project, return "EditMetadata " fearlessManager.projectsInfo[-=Project]
B action error messageErrorBase16NotAssociatedWithAnyRegisteredProject(Base16)

Define fearlessManager$delegate("Forget Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")"):
A action fearlessManager$checkFullTargetIsCorrect("Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")")
B action return "Forget " Base16

Define fearlessManager$delegate("Kind Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ") " Kind):
A action fearlessManager$checkFullTargetIsCorrect("Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")")
B fact fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16) = Project
C action return "EditMetadata " fearlessManager.projectsInfo[Project=Project[#kind=Infos.msg(Kind)]]

Define fearlessManager$delegate("Mount Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ") " TypeName " Full(" ProjectName' " " Base16' ")"):
A action fearlessManager$checkFullTargetIsCorrect("Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")")
B action fearlessManager$checkFullTargetIsCorrect("Full(" ProjectName' " " Base16' ")")
C fact fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16) = Project
D action return "EditMetadata " fearlessManager.projectsInfo[Project=Project[#mounts+=(TypeName->Infos.msg(ProjectName'))]]

Define fearlessManager$delegate("Unmount Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ") " TypeName):
A action fearlessManager$checkFullTargetIsCorrect("Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")")
B fact fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16) = Project
C action return "EditMetadata " fearlessManager.projectsInfo[Project=Project[#mounts/=TypeName]]

Define fearlessManager$delegate("Attenuate Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ") " TypeName " " TypeName1 " ".." " TypeNamen):
A action fearlessManager$checkFullTargetIsCorrect("Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")")
B fact fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16) = Project
C action return "EditMetadata " fearlessManager.projectsInfo[Project=Project[#attenuators+=(TypeName->Infos.list(Infos.msg(TypeName1) .. Infos.msg(TypeNamen)))]]

Define fearlessManager$delegate("SelectMains Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ") " TypeName1 " ".." " TypeNamen):
A action fearlessManager$checkFullTargetIsCorrect("Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")")
B fact fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16) = Project
C action return "EditMetadata " fearlessManager.projectsInfo[Project=Project[#mains=Infos.list(Infos.msg(TypeName1) .. Infos.msg(TypeNamen))]]

Define fearlessManager$checkProjectIsNotBusy(ProjectName,Base16):
A action fearlessManager$checkFullTargetIsCorrect("Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")")
B if Base16 in dom(fearlessManager.longLivedMessages), error messageErrorProjectIsBusy(ProjectName,Base16)

Define fearlessManager$checkMountedProject(ProjectName):
A fact fearlessManager.names.projectNameToBase16(ProjectName) is undefined.
B action fearlessManager.queue= "\tRefreshCache\n" fearlessManager.queue
C action error messageErrorNameNotAssociatedWithAnyRegisteredProject(ProjectName)

Define fearlessManager$checkMountedProject(ProjectName):
A fact fearlessManager.names.projectNameToBase16(ProjectName) = Base16
B action fearlessManager$checkFullTargetIsCorrect("Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")")
C fact fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16).#kind = Infos.msg(Kind)
D if Kind is not "data", error messageErrorMountedProjectIsNotOfKindData(ProjectName,Kind)

Define fearlessManager$dispatch("Compile Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")"):
A action fearlessManager$checkProjectIsNotBusy(ProjectName,Base16)
B action fearlessProject$checkIsCode(fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16))
C action fearlessManager.longLivedMessages+= (Base16->"Compile Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")")

Define fearlessManager$dispatch("Run Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")"):
A action fearlessManager$checkProjectIsNotBusy(ProjectName,Base16)
B action fearlessProject$checkCanRun(fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16))
C fact fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16).#mounts = Infos.map(TypeName1, Infos.msg(ProjectName1) .. TypeNamen, Infos.msg(ProjectNamen))
D action fearlessManager$checkMountedProject(ProjectName1) .. fearlessManager$checkMountedProject(ProjectNamen)
//later: more checks on the mounted Projects
//later: The mounts need to be up to date too
//later: a second kind of data, for a Fearless project that no program edits, comes back when fearlessManager needs to know that a Fearless project of kind "data" does not change and the types that the running Fearless projects mount that Fearless project on can not tell.
E action fearlessManager.longLivedMessages+= (Base16->"Run Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")")

Define fearlessManager$delegate("Terminate Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")"):
A action fearlessManager$checkFullTargetIsCorrect("Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")")
B action return "Terminate " Base16

Define fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage("Terminate " Base16):
A if Base16 not in dom(fearlessManager.longLivedMessages), error messageErrorProjectIsNotBusy(Base16)
B fact fearlessManager.longLivedMessages = LongLivedMap (Base16->LongLivedMessage) LongLivedMap'
C action fearlessManager.longLivedMessages= LongLivedMap LongLivedMap'

Define fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage("Check Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")"):
A action fearlessManager$checkFullTargetIsCorrect("Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")")
B action fearlessProject$checkWellShaped

Define fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage("Quit"):
A action fearlessManager renames the LockFile to no_manager.lock
B action fearlessManager stops listening for connections
C fact fearlessManager.queue = "\t" Message1 "\n" .. "\t" Messagen "\n"
D action fearlessManager answers "Refused\n" internalErrorManagerIsQuitting() to each of Message1 .. Messagen
E action fearlessManager.queue= ""
//later: sending progress lines to fearlessMessage

Invariant:
At every moment, at most one fearlessManager is the 'single' manager of one ManagerFolder.
At every moment, for each Base16 in dom(fearlessManager.longLivedMessages), fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16).#kind = Infos.msg("code").
At every moment, for each (Base16->"Run Full(" _ " " Base16 ")") in fearlessManager.longLivedMessages, and each ProjectName that fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16).#mounts maps a TypeName to, fearlessManager.names.projectNameToProject(fearlessManager.projectsInfo,ProjectName) is defined.
//later: according to our last view of the file system, running check on them would confirm they are valid.

Define fearlessManager$loadProjectsInfo():
A fact The file projects.info holds Info serialized.
B action fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage("EditMetadata " Info) ends with done.

Define fearlessManager$loadProjectsInfo():
A fact The file projects.info holds Info serialized.
B action fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage("EditMetadata " Info) ends with Error.
C action fearlessManager replaces projects.info with Infos.list() serialized

Define fearlessManager$loadProjectsInfo():
A fact The file projects.info does not hold an Info serialized.
B action fearlessManager replaces projects.info with Infos.list() serialized

Define fearlessManager$serve():
A fact fearlessManager holds the lock of no_manager.lock.
B action fearlessManager renames no_manager.lock to candidate_manager.lock
C action fearlessManager$loadProjectsInfo()
D action fearlessManager listens for connections on the loopback address, on the port Port that the OS picks
//later: copy the icons, Coordinator$dropUnfinished, buildMap, show the tray icon
//later: the operating system associates the extension .fearless with one version of fearlessManager, and only that version runs. A fearlessManager that starts finds whether it took that association from another version or already had it. A fearlessManager that took the association removes the caches of the projects, the folders .fearless_out: the package "base" changes only when the version changes, and no test of fearlessProject$compilePackage or of fearlessProject$checkIsUpToDate sees a change of "base".
E action fearlessManager renames candidate_manager.lock to "single_manager_at_" Port ".lock"
F after fearlessManager is the 'single' manager.

Story:
A event fearlessManager starts.
B fact At least one file of the folder at the 'manager path' has a name of form LockFile, and no process holds the lock of any of those files.
C action fearlessManager takes the lock of each of those files
D action fearlessManager deletes all of those files but one, and renames that one to no_manager.lock
E action fearlessManager$serve()

Story:
A event fearlessManager starts.
B fact No folder is at the 'manager path'.
C action fearlessManager creates the ManagerFolder at the 'manager path', with the LockFile no_manager.lock, projects.info holding Infos.list() serialized, and the empty folders icons and locks
D action fearlessManager takes the lock of no_manager.lock
E action fearlessManager$serve()

Story:
A event fearlessManager starts.
B fact No folder is at the 'manager path'.
C event Another process creates a folder at the 'manager path' before fearlessManager creates the ManagerFolder.
D action fearlessManager ends.

Story:
A event fearlessManager starts.
B fact In the folder at the 'manager path', another process holds the lock of no_manager.lock.
C action fearlessManager waits a little, then goes on as if fearlessManager started at that moment

Story:
A event fearlessManager starts.
B fact A folder is at the 'manager path', and no file of that folder has a name of form LockFile.
C action fearlessManager creates no_manager.lock in that folder, with the lock of no_manager.lock already taken
D action fearlessManager$serve()

Story:
A event fearlessManager starts.
B fact In the folder at the 'manager path', another process holds the lock of a file with a name of form LockFile that is not no_manager.lock.
C action fearlessManager ends.

Story:
A event fearlessManager receives Message from fearlessMessage.
B action fearlessManager.queue= fearlessManager.queue "\t" Message "\n"

Story:
A fact fearlessManager.queue = "\t" Message "\n" Queue
B action fearlessManager.queue= Queue
C fact Message.needsDelegation
D action fearlessManager$delegate(Message) = Message'
E action fearlessManager.queue= "\t" Message' "\n" Queue

Story:
A fact fearlessManager.queue = "\t" Message "\n" Queue
B action fearlessManager.queue= Queue
C fact Message.needsDelegation
D action fearlessManager$delegate(Message) ends with Error.
E action fearlessManager answers "Refused\n" Error

Story:
A fact fearlessManager.queue = "\t" Message "\n" Queue
B action fearlessManager.queue= Queue
C fact Message is of form DirectMessage.
D action fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage(Message) ends with done.
E action fearlessManager answers "Applied\n"

Story:
A fact fearlessManager.queue = "\t" Message "\n" Queue
B action fearlessManager.queue= Queue
C fact Message is of form DirectMessage.
D action fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage(Message) ends with Error.
E action fearlessManager answers "Refused\n" Error

Story:
A fact fearlessManager.queue = "\tRefreshCache\n" Queue
B fact fearlessManager.longLivedMessages = (Base160->_) .. (Base16n->_)
C action fearlessManager.queue= "\t" "Terminate " Base160 "\n" .. "\t" "Terminate " Base16n "\n" "\tRefreshCache\n" Queue

Story:
A fact fearlessManager.queue = "\tQuit\n" Queue
B fact fearlessManager.longLivedMessages = (Base160->_) .. (Base16n->_)
C action fearlessManager.queue= "\t" "Terminate " Base160 "\n" .. "\t" "Terminate " Base16n "\n" "\tQuit\n" Queue

Story:
A fact fearlessManager.queue = "\tQuit\n" Queue
B fact fearlessManager.longLivedMessages = {}
C action fearlessManager.queue= Queue
D action fearlessManager$directlyHandleMessage("Quit")
E action fearlessManager answers "Applied\n"
F action fearlessManager ends

Story:
A fact fearlessManager.queue = "\t" LongLivedMessage "\n" Queue
B action fearlessManager.queue= Queue
C action fearlessManager$dispatch(LongLivedMessage) ends with done.
D action fearlessManager answers "Applied\n"

Story:
A fact fearlessManager.queue = "\t" LongLivedMessage "\n" Queue
B action fearlessManager.queue= Queue
C action fearlessManager$dispatch(LongLivedMessage) ends with Error.
D action fearlessManager answers "Refused\n" Error

Story:
A fact (Base16->"Compile Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")") is added to fearlessManager.longLivedMessages.
B fact The 'child process' of that Compile, fearlessProject$compile, produces output.
C action fearlessManager answers "Refused\n" followed by that output to "Compile Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")", as that output is produced
D fact Base16 not in dom(fearlessManager.longLivedMessages).
E action fearlessProject$fearless_out+= ("last_compile_result.txt"->"Refused\n" followed by that output)
F action fearlessManager answers "Terminated\n" to "Compile Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")"

Story:
A fact (Base16->"Compile Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")") is added to fearlessManager.longLivedMessages.
B fact The 'child process' of that Compile, fearlessProject$compile, produces no output.
C fact Base16 not in dom(fearlessManager.longLivedMessages).
D action fearlessManager answers "Terminated\n" to "Compile Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")"

Story:
A fact (Base16->"Run Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")") is added to fearlessManager.longLivedMessages.
B action fearlessManager answers the output of the 'child process' of that Run, fearlessProject$run(fearlessManager.projectsInfo.get(Base16)), to "Run Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")", as that output is produced
C fact Base16 not in dom(fearlessManager.longLivedMessages).
D action fearlessManager answers "Terminated\n" to "Run Full(" ProjectName " " Base16 ")"

Implementation notes:
A Str is a Fearless string literal: #empty is "", #path is "path", #kind is "kind", #mains is "mains", #mounts is "mounts" and #attenuators is "attenuators".
TaggedText.str, TypeName.str, ProjectName.str and Kind.str are the Fearless string literals holding the text of TaggedText, of TypeName, of ProjectName and of Kind.
Each Message of fearlessManager.queue and of fearlessManager.longLivedMessages keeps the connection that the Message arrived on; a Message that fearlessManager$delegate returns keeps the connection of the Message it comes from; a Terminate Message that a Quit adds to fearlessManager.queue keeps the connection of that Quit; a Terminate Message that a "RefreshCache" adds to fearlessManager.queue keeps the connection of that "RefreshCache"; a "RefreshCache" that fearlessManager adds to fearlessManager.queue keeps the connection of the Message that fearlessManager refuses; fearlessManager answers a Message on that connection.
The 'manager path' is chosen by the implementation, and can differ between operating systems: each version of fearlessManager has its own ManagerFolder, and a copy of an installation is an independent installation with its own ManagerFolder.
The lock of a LockFile is the lock of FileChannel.tryLock: the OS releases the lock when the process ends, however the process ends, and the lock follows the file when the file is renamed.
fearlessManager finds that another process holds the lock by trying to take the lock: there is no separate check before taking the lock.
fearlessManager creates the ManagerFolder by filling a new folder next to the 'manager path', then renaming that new folder to the 'manager path': the rename fails when a folder is at the 'manager path' already.
fearlessManager creates no_manager.lock with the lock already taken by creating a file with another name, taking the lock of that file, then renaming that file to no_manager.lock: the rename fails when no_manager.lock exists already. A file that is created first and locked after can be deleted by another fearlessManager in between.
fearlessManager deletes a file with a name of form LockFile only while holding the lock of that file: on Linux a delete ignores the locks of other processes.
Only a fearlessManager renames a LockFile: a process that holds the lock of no_manager.lock can be any program, while a process that holds the lock of candidate_manager.lock is a fearlessManager that is starting.
The Port is in the name of the LockFile, not in the content: on Windows a process can not read a file that another process holds the lock of.
